@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> R1

state R1 <<choice>>
R1 --> IdentifyUser : [user makes request]
R1 --> GatherVideos : [system gathers videos]

state GatherVideos <<choice>>
GatherVideos --> AddDetails : [add thumbnails and view counts]
GatherVideos --> SendSuggestions : [send suggested videos]

state SendSuggestions
SendSuggestions : [suggestions sent to user]

@enduml
